    <string name="nika_whats_new_page_title">Nika \u2014 a screen reader for Android</string>
    <string name="nika_whats_new_page_text">What\'s new:\n\u2022 New items: Help and feedback (Telegram group, write to the developer, guide) and Updates (automatic check, check now).\n\u2022 Stopwatch and timer can say the time every 1 to 60 seconds, also on the lock screen (Clock settings).\n\u2022 Volume keys have their own actions for the lock screen.\n\u2022 The translator keys list names Grok (xAI) and Groq (Llama) differently.</string>
